// Hesk Durran, pad foreman on Terramonta. Gruff, fair, secretly sentimental.
// Shows: per-NPC flags ($this_*), a global flag, an item check, give/take/pay,
// reputation, disposition (<<mood>>), and a node you can't walk away from (noexit).

title: Start
---
<<if not $this_met>>
    Hesk: New face. Came in on the last shuttle? I'm Hesk. I run the pad crews here.
    <<set $this_met to true>>
<<elseif mood() >= 20>>
    Hesk: Spacer. Good timing, the coffee's fresh.
<<elseif mood() <= -20>>
    Hesk: You. Keep it short.
<<else>>
    Hesk: Back again. What is it?
<<endif>>
<<jump Menu>>
===

title: Menu
---
-> Need a hand with anything? <<if not $this_permit_given>>
    <<jump Work>>
-> About that ore order. <<if $this_permit_given and not $this_order_done>>
    <<jump Order>>
-> What's it like working here?
    <<jump Talk>>
-> Nice tusks. <<if not visited("Tusks")>>
    <<jump Tusks>>
-> I'll be going.
    <<jump Bye>>
===

title: Work
---
Hesk: Always. The refinery's short on raw ore and my crews are stretched thin.
Hesk: Bring me 5 Raw Minerals and I'll pay better than the exchange does.
-> Deal.
    Hesk: Good. Take this permit so security doesn't hassle you out at the rigs.
    <<give "Mining Permit" 1>>
    <<set $this_permit_given to true>>
    <<rep assembly 2>>
    <<mood 5>>
-> Not interested.
    Hesk: Your loss.
<<jump Menu>>
===

title: Order
---
<<if has_item("Raw Minerals", 5)>>
    Hesk: That's the lot? Let me see... Good rock. Here, as promised.
    <<take "Raw Minerals" 5>>
    <<pay 650>>
    <<rep assembly 5>>
    <<mood 15>>
    <<set $this_order_done to true>>
    <<set $terramonta_ore_delivered to true>>
<<else>>
    Hesk: I count {item_count("Raw Minerals")} Raw Minerals. I asked for 5.
<<endif>>
<<jump Menu>>
===

title: Talk
---
<<if mood() >= 20>>
    Hesk: Honestly? I like it. The rock doesn't lie to you.
    Hesk: Off shift I roast coffee and lose at chess. Don't tell the crews.
<<else>>
    Hesk: Hot, loud, and the pay's late. Same as everywhere.
<<endif>>
Hesk: {goods_opinion()}
<<jump Menu>>
===

title: Tusks
tags: noexit
---
Hesk: ...
Hesk: Say that again. Slowly.
-> I said they're nice. Really.
    Hesk: Hm. They are, aren't they.
    <<mood 5>>
-> You heard me.
    Hesk: I did.
    <<mood -25>>
<<jump Menu>>
===

title: Bye
---
<<if $this_order_done>>
    Hesk: Want more work, you know where to find me.
<<elseif mood() <= -20>>
    Hesk: Don't let the airlock hit you.
<<else>>
    Hesk: Mind the machines on your way out.
<<endif>>
===
